## Deployment

```bash
# Install dependencies
npm install

# Set secrets for dev
pulumi config set --secret dbPassword dev_password --stack dev

# Deploy to dev
pulumi stack select dev
pulumi up

# Set secrets for prod
pulumi config set --secret dbPassword prod_password --stack prod

# Deploy to prod
pulumi stack select prod
pulumi up

# View outputs
pulumi stack output bucketName
pulumi stack output dbEndpoint
pulumi stack output roleArn
```

## Acceptance Criteria Met

✅ **S3 Bucket**: Versioning enabled, AES-256 encryption, public access blocked  
✅ **RDS**: Deletion protection (prod), 7–30 day backup retention, multi-AZ (prod), KMS encryption (prod), no public access  
✅ **IAM**: Least-privilege policy (S3 object operations, RDS-db:connect only), no wildcards  
✅ **Environment Isolation**: Dev/prod via stack configs; independent deployable; dev allows force destroy, prod enforces deletion protection  
✅ **Encryption**: S3 AES-256, RDS KMS (prod), secrets via Pulumi ConfigSecret  
✅ **Replication**: Optional cross-region replication for prod to us-west-2
